result, not an unchecked axis. (Artifact: lvs_attempt_4/lvs_wbad.out.)

*** TRAP WORTH RECORDING FOR THIS FLOW ***
netgen prints "Final result: Circuits match uniquely." EVEN WHEN property
errors exist. Grepping for that line alone is a false-pass generator. The
verdict must also require the absence of "Property errors were found."

